t<li>\\n\\t<p>School B: Rs. 5,000 monthly + Rs. 15,000 annual<br \\/>\\n\\t<strong>Difference per year: Rs. 49,000 saved.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\"},\"position\":6,\"created_at\":\"2025-11-20T12:51:23.768803Z\"},{\"id\":\"element_9\",\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":{\"content\":\"<p>Many Pakistani parents assume government schools are low quality &mdash; but this is changing fast.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Some offer:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Highly qualified teachers<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Free books<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Modern classrooms<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Low or zero fees<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>\\u2714 Real Example:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Punjab&rsquo;s <strong>Daanish Schools<\\/strong> and KP&rsquo;s <strong>Government Model Schools<\\/strong> produce outstanding board results every year.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"position\":8,\"created_at\":\"2025-11-20T12:51:23.768844Z\"},{\"id\":\"element_11\",\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":{\"content\":\"<p>Many schools quietly offer discounts &mdash; parents just never ask.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Types of support available:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Merit-based scholarships<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Sibling discount<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Need-based fee relaxation<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>Orphan support programs<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>NGO-sponsored education<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>\\u2714 Real Example:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p><strong>Tameer-e-Millat Foundation<\\/strong> supports low-fee education for many families.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p><strong>Akhuwat Foundation<\\/strong> provides educational loans with zero interest.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\"},\"position\":10,\"created_at\":\"2025-11-20T12:51:23.768885Z\"},{\"id\":\"element_13\",\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":{\"content\":\"<p>Even if your child studies in a budget school, you can still provide high-quality learning at ho