(15, 'aae8cb6c-21be-4703-a4ba-723182cc941a', '[{\"id\":\"element_1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Hum AI aur Automation ke Zamane mein Hain \\u2014 Phir Schools Kyun Peeche Hain?\",\"level\":\"h2\"},\"position\":0,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-04T21:28:29.768814Z\"},{\"id\":\"element_3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Personal School Website \\u2014 Achha Idea, Lekin Ek Badi Problem\",\"level\":\"h2\"},\"position\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-04T21:28:29.768997Z\"},{\"id\":\"element_5\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Skoolyst \\u2014 Problem Ka Real Solution\",\"level\":\"h2\"},\"position\":4,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-04T21:28:29.769038Z\"},{\"id\":\"element_7\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Parents Ke Liye Bhi Fayda\",\"level\":\"h2\"},\"position\":6,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-04T21:28:29.769074Z\"}]', 1, 1, 15, 'Kya Aapke School Ka Apna Website Hona Zaroori Hai? — Ya Phir Ek Behtar Rasta Bhi Hai?', 'kya-aapke-school-ka-apna-website-hona-zaroori-hai-ya-phir-ek-behtar-rasta-bhi-hai', '{\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"element_1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Hum AI aur Automation ke Zamane mein Hain \\u2014 Phir Schools Kyun Peeche Hain?\",\"level\":\"h2\"},\"position\":0,\"languageDirection\":\"ltr\"},{\"id\":\"element_2\",\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":{\"content\":\"<p>Socho zara &mdash; jab ghar bethe koi product kharidna ho, toh hum e-commerce sites pe jaate hain. Gaari chahiye? Centralized platforms hain. Information chahiye? Google hai. Har field apne aap ko update kar chuka hai &mdash; except ek jagah:&nbsp;<strong>schools.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Aaj bhi parents ko school dhundhne ke liye gali gali ghoomna padta hai. Street banners dekh ke decide karna padta hai. Aur phir bhi poori information nahi milti. Yeh 2025 ki haqeeqat hai &mdash; aur yeh accept karna mushkil hai.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Sochne wali baat:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Ek street banner pe sirf school ka naam aur address likhna &mdash; kya yeh kaafi hai aaj ke digital parent ko convince karne ke liye?<\\/p>\\n\"},\"position\":1,\"languageDirection\":\"ltr\"},{\"id\":\"element_3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Personal School Website \\u2014 Achha Idea, Lekin Ek Badi Problem\",\"level\":\"h2\"},\"position\":2,\"languageDirection\":\"ltr\"},{\"id\":\"element_4\",\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":{\"content\":\"<p>Kai school owners ne socha: &quot;Apna website banaate hain!&quot; &mdash; aur yeh soch buri nahi. Lekin problem yahan se shuru hoti hai:&nbsp;<em>har school ka alag website, alag design, alag layout.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Jab parents kisi school ko dhundhte hain, toh unhe pehle website dhundhni padti hai. Phir us website pe navigate karna padta hai. Aur phir bhi yeh information aksar nahi milti:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Fees Structure<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Facilities<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Curriculum<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Faculty Strength<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Student Strength<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Location &amp; Address<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Established Year<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Admin Details<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Yeh woh information hai jo har parent jaanna chahta hai &mdash; aur yeh ek hi jagah milni chahiye. Yahi problem thi. Aur isi problem ka jawab hai&nbsp;<strong>Skoolyst.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\"},\"position\":3,\"languageDirection\":\"ltr\"},{\"id\":\"element_5\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Skoolyst \\u2014 Problem Ka Real Solution\",\"level\":\"h2\"},\"position\":4,\"languageDirection\":\"ltr\"},{\"id\":\"element_6\",\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":{\"content\":\"<p>Skoolyst ek centralized digital platform hai &mdash; jahan pe schools apni poori details list kar sakti hain, aur parents ek hi jagah se sabhi schools ki compare kar sakte hain. Bilkul waise jaise aap e-commerce pe products compare karte hain.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Skoolyst pe aap kya kar sakte hain?<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>School register karein &mdash; basic info, email aur password se shuru karein<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Dashboard mein logo, cover image, gallery aur additional details add karein<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Publish status active karein &mdash; aur apni school Skoolyst ki list mein show ho jaye<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Articles likhein &mdash; parents aur students ko guide karein school choose karne ke baare mein<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Parents reviews aur feedback de sakein &mdash; school ki credibility badhe<\\/p>\\n\"},\"position\":5,\"languageDirection\":\"ltr\"},{\"id\":\"element_7\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Parents Ke Liye Bhi Fayda\",\"level\":\"h2\"},\"position\":6,\"languageDirection\":\"ltr\"},{\"id\":\"element_8\",\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":{\"content\":\"<p>Sirf schools hi nahi &mdash; parents bhi Skoolyst ka hissa bain sakte hain. Woh listed schools ke baare mein honest reviews de sakte hain, doosre parents ki madad kar sakte hain, aur platform ko improve karne ke liye feedback form bhar sakte hain&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/skoolyst.com\\/\\\">skoolyst.com<\\/a>&nbsp;pe. Yahi community spirit Skoolyst ko sirf ek directory se zyada banata hai &mdash; yeh ek living, breathing education network hai.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Aaj hi apni school register karein<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Agar aap school owner hain, toh intezaar mat karein. Skoolyst pe apni school list karein, parents tak pahunchein, aur ek strong school community ka hissa banein.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/skoolyst.com\\/\\\">skoolyst.com pe jaayein<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Kya aap is topic pe apni raay dena chahte hain? Neeche feedback form fill karein ya humse rabta karein skoolyst.com pe.<br \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Yeh rahaa aapka professional Roman Urdu blog post! Yahan kuch cheezein hain jo is post ko engaging banati hain:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Title<\\/strong> &mdash; curiosity-driven hai, seedha question puchha hai jo reader ke zehan mein hoga.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Opening hook<\\/strong> &mdash; pehle AI era ki baat, phir contrast dikhaya ke schools kyun peeche hain &mdash; yeh reader ko baandhta hai.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Problem ko visually dikhaya<\\/strong> &mdash; fees structure, curriculum waghera ko colored tiles mein dikhaya taake readers instantly samjhein.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Skoolyst ka introduction<\\/strong> &mdash; problem ke baad naturally aata hai, sales-y nahi lagta.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Clear call-to-action<\\/strong> &mdash; end mein green box mein register karne ka invitation, link ke saath.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Agar aap chahein toh main yeh bhi kar sakta hoon:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Is blog post ko copy-paste karne ke liye plain text format mein de sakta hoon<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Social media caption (Instagram\\/Facebook) bhi likh sakta hoon is ke liye<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Alag posts ke liye bhi help kar sakta hoon<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\"},\"position\":7,\"languageDirection\":\"ltr\"}],\"metadata\":{\"created\":\"2026-05-04T21:28:27.317Z\",\"total_elements\":8,\"version\":\"1.0\"}}', 'Is article mein aap janenge ke apne school ke liye alag website banana kaisa ek costly galti ho sakti hai — aur is problem ka ek smart, modern solution kya hai.', '<h2>Hum AI aur Automation ke Zamane mein Hain — Phir Schools Kyun Peeche Hain?</h2><p>Socho zara &mdash; jab ghar bethe koi product kharidna ho, toh hum e-commerce sites pe jaate hain. Gaari chahiye? Centralized platforms hain. Information chahiye? Google hai. Har field apne aap ko update kar chuka hai &mdash; except ek jagah:&nbsp;<strong>schools.</strong></p>\n\n<p>Aaj bhi parents ko school dhundhne ke liye gali gali ghoomna padta hai. Street banners dekh ke decide karna padta hai. Aur phir bhi poori information nahi milti. Yeh 2025 ki haqeeqat hai &mdash; aur yeh accept karna mushkil hai.</p>\n\n<p>Sochne wali baat:</p>\n\n<p>Ek street banner pe sirf school ka naam aur address likhna &mdash; kya yeh kaafi hai aaj ke digital parent ko convince karne ke liye?</p>\n<h2>Personal School Website — Achha Idea, Lekin Ek Badi Problem</h2><p>Kai school owners ne socha: &quot;Apna website banaate hain!&quot; &mdash; aur yeh soch buri nahi. Lekin problem yahan se shuru hoti hai:&nbsp;<em>har school ka alag website, alag design, alag layout.</em></p>\n\n<p>Jab parents kisi school ko dhundhte hain, toh unhe pehle website dhundhni padti hai. Phir us website pe navigate karna padta hai. Aur phir bhi yeh information aksar nahi milti:</p>\n\n<p>Fees Structure</p>\n\n<p>Facilities</p>\n\n<p>Curriculum</p>\n\n<p>Faculty Strength</p>\n\n<p>Student Strength</p>\n\n<p>Location &amp; Address</p>\n\n<p>Established Year</p>\n\n<p>Admin Details</p>\n\n<p>Yeh woh information hai jo har parent jaanna chahta hai &mdash; aur yeh ek hi jagah milni chahiye. Yahi problem thi. Aur isi problem ka jawab hai&nbsp;<strong>Skoolyst.</strong></p>\n<h2>Skoolyst — Problem Ka Real Solution</h2><p>Skoolyst ek centralized digital platform hai &mdash; jahan pe schools apni poori details list kar sakti hain, aur parents ek hi jagah se sabhi schools ki compare kar sakte hain. Bilkul waise jaise aap e-commerce pe products compare karte hain.</p>\n\n<p>Skoolyst pe aap kya kar sakte hain?</p>\n\n<p>School register karein &mdash; basic info, email aur password se shuru karein</p>\n\n<p>Dashboard mein logo, cover image, gallery aur additional details add karein</p>\n\n<p>Publish status active karein &mdash; aur apni school Skoolyst ki list mein show ho jaye</p>\n\n<p>Articles likhein &mdash; parents aur students ko guide karein school choose karne ke baare mein</p>\n\n<p>Parents reviews aur feedback de sakein &mdash; school ki credibility badhe</p>\n<h2>Parents Ke Liye Bhi Fayda</h2><p>Sirf schools hi nahi &mdash; parents bhi Skoolyst ka hissa bain sakte hain. Woh listed schools ke baare mein honest reviews de sakte hain, doosre parents ki madad kar sakte hain, aur platform ko improve karne ke liye feedback form bhar sakte hain&nbsp;<a href=\"https://skoolyst.com/\">skoolyst.com</a>&nbsp;pe. Yahi community spirit Skoolyst ko sirf ek directory se zyada banata hai &mdash; yeh ek living, breathing education network hai.</p>\n\n<p>Aaj hi apni school register karein</p>\n\n<p>Agar aap school owner hain, toh intezaar mat karein. Skoolyst pe apni school list karein, parents tak pahunchein, aur ek strong school community ka hissa banein.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://skoolyst.com/\">skoolyst.com pe jaayein</a></p>\n\n<p>Kya aap is topic pe apni raay dena chahte hain? Neeche feedback form fill karein ya humse rabta karein skoolyst.com pe.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Yeh rahaa aapka professional Roman Urdu blog post! Yahan kuch cheezein hain jo is post ko engaging banati hain:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Title</strong> &mdash; curiosity-driven hai, seedha question puchha hai jo reader ke zehan mein hoga.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Opening hook</strong> &mdash; pehle AI era ki baat, phir contrast dikhaya ke schools kyun peeche hain &mdash; yeh reader ko baandhta hai.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Problem ko visually dikhaya</strong> &mdash; fees structure, curriculum waghera ko colored tiles mein dikhaya taake readers instantly samjhein.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Skoolyst ka introduction</strong> &mdash; problem ke baad naturally aata hai, sales-y nahi lagta.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Clear call-to-action</strong> &mdash; end mein green box mein register karne ka invitation, link ke saath.</p>\n\n<p>Agar aap chahein toh main yeh bhi kar sakta hoon:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Is blog post ko copy-paste karne ke liye plain text format mein de sakta hoon</li>\n	<li>Social media caption (Instagram/Facebook) bhi likh sakta hoon is ke liye</li>\n	<li>Alag posts ke liye bhi help kar sakta hoon</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n', 'blog/featured-images/d4140b20-da0c-48c4-8b72-129e7c8fd21f.webp', '[\"Skoolyst\",\"schoolwebsite\"]', 138, 9.85190, 4, 'published', 1, '2026-05-04 02:19:00', 'Kya School Ka Apna Website Zaroori Hai? — Skoolyst Se Behtar Rasta Jaanein', 'Apne school ke liye alag website banana costly aur complicated hai. Jaanein ke Skoolyst — ek centralized digital platform — kaise aapki school ko parents aur students tak pahunchata hai, fees structure se le kar faculty details tak, sab ek jagah.', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":\"element_2\",\