(11, 22, 'Pre-School Campus Clifton', 'Plot St:# 22 Marine Promenade Block-1, Clifton, Karachi, Pakistan', 'Karachi', '021-34166250-1', 'Zainab Rangwala (Vice Principal)', 'Ideally situated in Clifton Block 1, Main Marine Promenade Road, with a picturesque view of the sea. This pre-school offers thoughtfully designed, spacious classrooms supported by two experienced teachers in every class, ensuring individual attention for each child. The campus features a Reggio Emilia-inspired Early Years Foundation Stage (EYFS) curriculum with inquiry-based learning. The Parents as Partners programme engages parents as active participants in their child\'s learning. The campus includes art room, mud kitchen, auditorium, outside play area, rooftop, music room, library, and water play facilities.', NULL, NULL, 'Cambridge, EYFS (Reggio Emilia-inspired)', 'Playgroup, Reception, Prep I, Prep II (1 year 7 months to 5 years 3 months)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'active', '2026-06-26 12:46:23', '2026-06-26 12:46:23'),
(12, 22, 'Junior Campus Clifton', 'St: #25-B Marine Promenade Road, Block-2 Clifton, Karachi, Pakistan', 'Karachi', '021-35864162-4', 'Najia Fahad (Principal)', 'Located on Main Marine Promenade Road with a picturesque view of the sea, this purpose-built campus serves primary learners. Two teachers are appointed in each classroom for Grades 1-4 to ensure personal attention. In Grade 5, teaching is more subject-based. The curriculum follows a Reggio-Emilia inspired \'Learn Through Discovery\' approach for Grades 1-2 and an IGCSE framework for Grades 3-5. The campus features spacious, naturally lit classrooms with air conditioning and projectors. Facilities include art room, auditorium, IT room, library, multimedia room, music room, playground, and science lab.', 'co-education', NULL, 'Cambridge, IGCSE framework', 'Grade 1 to 5', NULL, '[\"1\",\"4\",\"5\",\"6\",\"7\",\"8\",\"10\",\"11\",\"12\",\"13\",\"14\",\"15\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 'active', '2026-06-26 12:49:14', '2026-06-26 14:37:11'),
(13, 22, 'Senior Campus Clifton', 'Plot St:# 22-B Marine Promenade Block-1, Clifton Karachi, Pakistan', 'Karachi', '021-34166252', 'Tehmina Shahab (Principal)', 'A state-of-the-art, purpose-built campus strategically located on Main Marine Promenade Road, providing students with easy access and a seamless journey from early years to senior grades. The campus has been designed with 21st-century learners in mind, featuring spacious modern classrooms equipped with air conditioning and advanced technology integration. The school follows the Cambridge curriculum, offering a strong foundation for students aged 11 to 14, leading to Cambridge IGCSE/O levels. Facilities include art studio, modern cafeteria, learning hub, IT lab, indoor games area, science lab, theatre, and auditorium.', 'co-education', NULL, 'Cambridge, IGCSE', 'Grade 6 to 8 (expanding to O Levels)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'active', '2026-06-26 12:54:08', '2026-06-26 12:54:08'),
(14, 22, 'Pre-School Campus KDA', 'St: #SNPA 30, Block-7 & 8 Opp. Kathiawar Hall, Adamjee Naggar, KDA-1, Karachi, Pakistan', 'Karachi', '021-34322065', 'Barbara Pereira (Principal)', 'Tucked in Central KDA and accessible from various points of the city, this cozy pre-school is a vibrant hub of creativity perfect for children\'s growth. The campus offers thoughtfully designed, spacious classrooms supported by two experienced teachers in every class, ensuring individual attention. The Reggio Emilia-inspired early years programme stimulates children\'s thinking, communication, investigation, exploration, and problem-solving skills. Facilities include art room, indoor play area, outdoor play area, library, music room, digital classrooms, water play, and after-school activities.', 'co-education', NULL, 'Cambridge, EYFS (Reggio Emilia-inspired)', 'Playgroup, Reception, Prep I, Prep II (1 year 7 months to 5 years 3 months)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'active', '2026-06-26 12:56:48', '2026-06-26 12:56:48'),
(15, 22, 'Junior Campus PECHS', 'Plot No. 3/2, Darul Aman CHS, Karachi, Pakistan', 'Karachi', '0331-2354592', 'Ms. Saniah Haque (Principal)', 'Centrally located and easily accessible from several central points of the city, the PECHS campus provides a vibrant, cheerful, and welcoming environment. Two teachers are appointed in every classroom till Grade IV to ensure personal attention. The curriculum follows a Reggio-Emilia inspired \'Learn Through Discovery\' approach for Grades 1-2 and an IGCSE framework for Grades 3-5. Upon completing Grade 5, students transition seamlessly to the Senior Heritage Campus. Facilities include art room, playground, music room, outside play area, science lab, IT lab, indoor sports room, and an adjoined playground.', 'co-education', 'Tuition Fees (Monthly)	\r\nRs. 38,480	Rs. 40,828	Rs. 42,677	Rs. 46,375\r\nTuition Fees x 12	\r\nRs. 461,760	Rs. 489,936	Rs. 512,124	Rs. 556,500', 'Cambridge, IGCSE framework', 'Grade 1 to 5', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'active', '2026-06-26 13:42:27', '2026-06-26 13:42:27'),
(16, 22, 'Senior Heritage Campus (Civil Lines)', '8th Flench Street, Civil Lines, Karachi, Pakistan', 'Karachi', '021-37235239', 'Shams Samson (Principal)', 'The Heritage campus is located centrally in Civil Lines and easily accessible from several central points of the city. This stunning, one-of-a-kind Heritage property from the early 20th century has been complemented with a large purpose-built new wing housing additional well-lit air-conditioned classrooms, a lecture theatre, multipurpose halls, an art studio, computer laboratory, and two Cambridge-approved science laboratories.\r\n\r\nThe Middle Years (Grades 6-8) build a strong foundation for Cambridge IGCSE and GCE O Levels with personalized learning. The Senior Years (Grades 9-11) follow the renowned Cambridge IGCSE and GCE O Levels curriculum. Students consistently attain outstanding academic results with multiple Top in the World and Top in Pakistan awards. Facilities include art room, basketball court, cafeteria, IT lab, lecture theatre, multipurpose room, library, and science labs.', 'co-education', NULL, 'Cambridge, IGCSE, O-Level', 'Grade 6 to 11 (O Levels/IGCSE), Ages 11-16 years', NULL, '[\"1\",\"4\",\"5\",\"6\",\"7\",\"8\",\"10\",\"11\",\"12\",\"13\",\"14\",\"15\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 'active', '2026-06-26 15:22:30', '2026-06-26 15:22:30'),
