 treatment, or Hafiz-e-Quran. Shaheen also emphasizes interactive and continuous learning methods, with extracurricular activities like Nazra, Earth Day celebrations, interschool matches, and competitions such as Maths Genius and Spell Master. Its social media presence includes active Facebook and Instagram pages. With 44 years of trust and growth, Shaheen Public School & College continues to be a leading affordable private school in Karachi, committed to shaping future leaders through quality education and development.\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:88:\"school/shaheen-public-school-college/banner/XhiFY6RW91dw7CBQJxhS05Uhhab0U5CfY4sZUbW9.jpg\";s:12:\"banner_title\";s:31:\"Shaheen Public School & College\";s:14:\"banner_tagline\";N;s:4:\"logo\";N;s:10:\"facilities\";N;s:18:\"school_gender_type\";s:12:\"co-education\";s:21:\"school_ownership_type\";s:7:\"private\";s:12:\"regular_fees\";N;s:15:\"discounted_fees\";N;s:15:\"class_wise_fees\";s:27:\"{\"Estimated\":\"5000 - 8000\"}\";s:14:\"admission_fees\";N;s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:10:\"visibility\";s:6:\"public\";s:12:\"publish_date\";s:19:\"2026-04-07 06:18:00\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-07 06:18:10\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-08 08:04:33\";s:18:\"fee_structure_type\";s:10:\"class_wise\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:6:{s:12:\"publish_date\";s:8:\"datetime\";s:18:\"school_gender_type\";s:26:\"App\\Enums\\SchoolGenderType\";s:21:\"school_ownership_type\";s:29:\"App\\Enums\\SchoolOwnershipType\";s:18:\"fee_structure_type\";s:26:\"App\\Enums\\FeeStructureType\";s:6:\"status\";s:22:\"App\\Enums\\ActiveStatus\";s:10:\"visibility\";s:26:\"App\\Enums\\SchoolVisibility\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:8:{s:7:\"profile\";O:24:\"App\\Models\\SchoolProfile\":33:{s:13:\"\