:\"address\";s:87:\"St: #SNPA 30, Block-7 & 8 Opp. Kathiawar Hall, Adamjee Naggar, KDA-1, Karachi, Pakistan\";s:4:\"city\";s:7:\"Karachi\";s:14:\"contact_number\";s:12:\"021-34322065\";s:16:\"branch_head_name\";s:27:\"Barbara Pereira (Principal)\";s:11:\"description\";s:598:\"Tucked in Central KDA and accessible from various points of the city, this cozy pre-school is a vibrant hub of creativity perfect for children\'s growth. The campus offers thoughtfully designed, spacious classrooms supported by two experienced teachers in every class, ensuring individual attention. The Reggio Emilia-inspired early years programme stimulates children\'s thinking, communication, investigation, exploration, and problem-solving skills. Facilities include art room, indoor play area, outdoor play area, library, music room, digital classrooms, water play, and after-school activities.\";s:11:\"school_type\";s:12:\"co-education\";s:13:\"fee_structure\";N;s:11:\"curriculums\";s:40:\"Cambridge, EYFS (Reggio Emilia-inspired)\";s:7:\"classes\";s:75:\"Playgroup, Reception, Prep I, Prep II (1 year 7 months to 5 years 3 months)\";s:14:\"images_gallery\";N;s:8:\"features\";N;s:8:\"latitude\";N;s:9:\"longitude\";N;s:14:\"is_main_branch\";i:0;s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 12:56:48\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 12:56:48\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:20:{s:2:\"id\";i:14;s:9:\"school_id\";i:22;s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"Pre-School Campus KDA\";s:7:\"address\";s:87:\"St: #SNPA 30, Block-7 & 8 Opp. Kathiawar Hall, Adamjee Naggar, KDA-1, Karachi, Pakistan\";s:4:\"city\";s:7:\"Karachi\";s:14:\"contact_number\";s:12:\"021-34322065\";s:16:\"branch_head_name\";s:27:\"Barbara Pereira (Principal)\";s:11:\"description\";s:598:\"Tucked in Central KDA and accessible from various points of the city, this cozy pre-school is a vibrant hub of creativity perfect for children\'s growth. The campus offers thoughtfully designed, spacious classrooms supported by two experienced tea