('skoolyst-cache-school:slug:bay-view-high-school-bvhs:publicShow', 'O:17:\"App\\Models\\School\":33:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:7:\"schools\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:27:{s:2:\"id\";i:22;s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"7d47e1aa-36d9-403e-935d-b49bdd019732\";s:4:\"slug\";s:25:\"bay-view-high-school-bvhs\";s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Bay View High School (BVHS)\";s:5:\"email\";s:26:\"queries@bayviewhigh.edu.pk\";s:7:\"address\";s:64:\"Plot St:# 22 Marine Promenade Block-1 Clifton, Karachi, Pakistan\";s:4:\"city\";s:7:\"Karachi\";s:14:\"contact_number\";s:14:\"021-35864162-4\";s:7:\"website\";s:31:\"https://www.bayviewhigh.edu.pk/\";s:11:\"description\";s:1490:\"Bay View High School (BVHS) was founded by Mrs. Karen Ahmed in 1994 with a vision to create a school environment where learning is exciting and enjoyable. Her aim was to cultivate a genuine love of learning by empowering students to achieve their own potential with confidence.\r\n\r\n30 years later, BVHS is one of the top schools in Karachi, leading the way with holistic student-centred programmes, teaching 21st Century skills for 21st-century learners. Within its inclusive and nurturing community, children feel grounded, valued and ready to take on the world.\r\n\r\nToday, BVHS is a network of six modern, attractive, air-conditioned campuses across Karachi. Each provides a welcoming and stimulating learning environment, with a wonderful team of excited educators. The ethos that every individual matters is woven through Academic, Co-Curricular and Emotional Well-Being programmes encouraging the optimal holistic development of each child at all stages. BVHS recognizes the uniqueness of each child, assisting them to develop their individual interests and strengths.\r\n\r\nBVHS students consistently attain outstanding academic results at Cambridge GCE O Level, with a record of students achieving Cambridge High Achiever recognition. Multiple students have secured Top in the World and Top in Pakistan Awards, most recently in the June 2025 examinations. BVHS students attend prestigious universities across the globe and continue on to successful careers in a wide range of professions.\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:81:\"school/bay-view-high-school-bvhs/banner/b304e72e-193a-4145-96da-63ae45a89a28.webp\";s:12:\"banner_title\";N;s:14:\"banner_tagline\";N;s:4:\"logo\";N;s:10:\"facilities\";s:1759:\"Bay View High School offers a comprehensive range of modern facilities across its six purpose-built campuses designed as enabling learning environments:\r\n\r\nAcademic Facilities: The school features well-stocked libraries with extensive collections and digital resources, modern computer and IT labs with the latest technology, Cambridge-approved science laboratories for physics, chemistry, and biology with hands-on practical experience, and digital smart classrooms equipped with interactive whiteboards and projectors. The learning hubs and dedicated spaces support collaborative and independent study.\r\n\r\nArts & Creative Facilities: Students have access to creative art studios for painting and craft activities, professional dance studios with mirrored walls, and comprehensive music academies with various instruments.\r\n\r\nGeneral Facilities: The campuses include large auditoriums for events and performances, modern hygienic cafeterias serving nutritious meals, fully equipped medical rooms with qualified staff, and school bus transportation services for students.\r\n\r\nSafety & Security: All campuses are equipped with 24/7 CCTV surveillance and strict security protocols to ensure student safety.\r\n\r\nSports Facilities: The school offers large playgrounds for various sports including cricket, football, and basketball, dedicated basketball courts, indoor sports rooms for badminton, table tennis, and taekwondo, and swimming programs. The school has produced national-level athletes including Commonwealth Games swimming representative.\r\n\r\nSpecial Features for Early Years: Pre-school campuses feature water play areas, mud kitchens for sensory play, secure outdoor play areas, indoor play areas for all-weather activities, and rooftop activity spaces.\";s:18:\"school_gender_type\";s:12:\"co-education\";s:21:\"school_ownership_type\";s:7:\"private\";s:12:\"regular_fees\";N;s:15:\"discounted_fees\";N;s:15:\"class_wise_fees\";s:187:\"{\"Security Deposit (Refundable)\":\"40,000\",\"Annual Charges\":\"12,000\",\"Examination Fees: Twice a Year\":\"500\",\"Intercampus Transfer Fees\":\"50,000\",\"Tuition Fees (Monthly)\":\"38,480 - 46,375\"}\";s:14:\"admission_fees\";s:7:\"290,000\";s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:10:\"visibility\";s:6:\"public\";s:12:\"publish_date\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 00:00:00\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 12:04:10\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 12:39:52\";s:18:\"fee_structure_type\";s:10:\"class_wise\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:27:{s:2:\"id\";i:22;s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"7d47e1aa-36d9-403e-935d-b49bdd019732\";s:4:\"slug\";s:25:\"bay-view-high-school-bvhs\";s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Bay View High School (BVHS)\";s:5:\"email\";s:26:\"queries@bayviewhigh.edu.pk\";s:7:\"address\";s:64:\"Plot St:# 22 Marine Promenade Block-1 Clifton, Karachi, Pakistan\";s:4:\"city\";s:7:\"Karachi\";s:14:\"contact_number\";s:14:\"021-35864162-4\";s:7:\"website\";s:31:\"https://www.bayviewhigh.edu.pk/\";s:11:\"description\";s:1490:\"Bay View High School (BVHS) was founded by Mrs. Karen Ahmed in 1994 with a vision to create a school environment where learning is exciting and enjoyable. Her aim was to cultivate a genuine love of learning by empowering students to achieve their own potential with confidence.\r\n\r\n30 years later, BVHS is one of the top schools in Karachi, leading the way with holistic student-centred programmes, teaching 21st Century skills for 21st-century learners. Within its inclusive and nurturing community, children feel grounded, valued and ready to take on the world.\r\n\r\nToday, BVHS is a network of six modern, attractive, air-conditioned campuses across Karachi. Each provides a welcoming and stimulating learning environment, with a wonderful team of excited educators. The ethos that every individual matters is woven through Academic, Co-Curricular and Emotional Well-Being programmes encouraging the optimal holistic development of each child at all stages. BVHS recognizes the uniqueness of each child, assisting them to develop their individual interests and strengths.\r\n\r\nBVHS students consistently attain outstanding academic results at Cambridge GCE O Level, with a record of students achieving Cambridge High Achiever recognition. Multiple students have secured Top in the World and Top in Pakistan Awards, most recently in the June 2025 examinations. BVHS students attend prestigious universities across the globe and continue on to successful careers in a wide range of professions.\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:81:\"school/bay-view-high-school-bvhs/banner/b304e72e-193a-4145-96da-63ae45a89a28.webp\";s:12:\"banner_title\";N;s:14:\"banner_tagline\";N;s:4:\"logo\";N;s:10:\"facilities\";s:1759:\"Bay View High School offers a comprehensive range of modern facilities across its six purpose-built campuses designed as enabling learning environments:\r\n\r\nAcademic Facilities: The school features well-stocked libraries with extensive collections and digital resources, modern computer and IT labs with the latest technology, Cambridge-approved science laboratories for physics, chemistry, and biology with hands-on practical experience, and digital smart classrooms equipped with interactive whiteboards and projectors. The learning hubs and dedicated spaces support collaborative and independent study.\r\n\r\nArts & Creative Facilities: Students have access to creative art studios for painting and craft activities, professional dance studios with mirrored walls, and comprehensive music academies with various instruments.\r\n\r\nGeneral Facilities: The campuses include large auditoriums for events and performances, modern hygienic cafeterias serving nutritious meals, fully equipped medical rooms with qualified staff, and school bus transportation services for students.\r\n\r\nSafety & Security: All campuses are equipped with 24/7 CCTV surveillance and strict security protocols to ensure student safety.\r\n\r\nSports Facilities: The school offers large playgrounds for various sports including cricket, football, and basketball, dedicated basketball courts, indoor sports rooms for badminton, table tennis, and taekwondo, and swimming programs. The school has produced national-level athletes including Commonwealth Games swimming representative.\r\n\r\nSpecial Features for Early Years: Pre-school campuses feature water play areas, mud kitchens for sensory play, secure outdoor play areas, indoor play areas for all-weather activities, and rooftop activity spaces.\";s:18:\"school_gender_type\";s:12:\"co-education\";s:21:\"school_ownership_type\";s:7:\"private\";s:12:\"regular_fees\";N;s:15:\"discounted_fees\";N;s:15:\"class_wise_fees\";s:187:\"{\"Security Deposit (Refundable)\":\"40,000\",\"Annual Charges\":\"12,000\",\"Examination Fees: Twice a Year\":\"500\",\"Intercampus Transfer Fees\":\"50,000\",\"Tuition Fees (Monthly)\":\"38,480 - 46,375\"}\";s:14:\"admission_fees\";s:7:\"290,000\";s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:10:\"visibility\";s:6:\"public\";s:12:\"publish_date\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 00:00:00\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 12:04:10\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 12:39:52\";s:18:\"fee_structure_type\";s:10:\"class_wise\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:6:{s:12:\"publish_date\";s:8:\"datetime\";s