 perfect for children\'s growth. The campus offers thoughtfully designed, spacious classrooms supported by two experienced teachers in every class, ensuring individual attention. The Reggio Emilia-inspired early years programme stimulates children\'s thinking, communication, investigation, exploration, and problem-solving skills. Facilities include art room, indoor play area, outdoor play area, library, music room, digital classrooms, water play, and after-school activities.\";s:11:\"school_type\";s:12:\"co-education\";s:13:\"fee_structure\";N;s:11:\"curriculums\";s:40:\"Cambridge, EYFS (Reggio Emilia-inspired)\";s:7:\"classes\";s:75:\"Playgroup, Reception, Prep I, Prep II (1 year 7 months to 5 years 3 months)\";s:14:\"images_gallery\";N;s:8:\"features\";N;s:8:\"latitude\";N;s:9:\"longitude\";N;s:14:\"is_main_branch\";i:0;s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 12:56:48\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-26 12:56:48\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:6:{s:14:\"is_main_branch\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:8:\"latitude\";s:9:\"decimal:8\";s:9:\"longitude\";s:9:\"decimal:8\";s:8:\"features\";s:5:\"array\";s:11:\"school_type\";s:26:\"App\\Enums\\SchoolGenderType\";s:6:\"status\";s:22:\"App\\Enums\\ActiveStatus\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:9:\"school_id\";i:1;s:4:\"name\";i:2;s:7:\"address\";i:3;s:4:\"city\";i:4;s:14:\"contact_number\";i:5;s:16:\"branch_head_name\";i:6;s:11:\"description\";i:7;s:11:\"school_type\";i:8;s:13:\"fee_structure\";i:9;s:11:\"curriculums\