(567, '372050c7-3f46-44aa-905d-d72ff96765a7', 73, 2, 'The struggle for Pakistan was described as not only a political movement but also what type of movement?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"An economic movement\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"A military movement\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"An ideological movement\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"A cultural movement only\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The struggle for Pakistan was not only a political movement but also an ideological movement as Muslim leaders believed Muslims constituted a separate nation with their own religious and cultural identity.', 'Ideas and beliefs drove the movement as much as politics.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"ideology\\\",\\\"Pakistan movement\\\",\\\"ideological\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan Studies', '6', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-25 14:45:54', '2026-04-25 14:45:54'),
