(1333, '393b6c0f-fae4-4d9b-972c-da24fc3c8379', 28, 1, 'What type of political system does Pakistan operate under?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Presidential democracy\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Federal parliamentary democratic republic\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Constitutional monarchy\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Unitary state\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan is a federal parliamentary democratic republic as established by the 1973 Constitution.', 'Think about the role of the Prime Minister vs President.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"constitution\\\",\\\"political-system\\\",\\\"intro\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30');
