(1334, 'e64c8faa-7a5a-4449-98e2-38dbd0f6018f', 28, 1, 'Which constitution forms the basis of Pakistan\'s current political system?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Constitution of 1956\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Constitution of 1962\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Constitution of 1973\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Constitution of 1985\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The Constitution of 1973 is the current operative constitution of Pakistan.', 'It was enacted during Zulfikar Ali Bhutto\'s government.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"constitution\\\",\\\"1973\\\",\\\"intro\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1335, '68242123-7279-4a07-bf3f-805ae6baebed', 28, 1, 'In Pakistan\'s political system, who is the head of government?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"President\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Prime Minister\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Chief Justice\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Chairman Senate\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The Prime Minister is the head of government while the President is the head of state.', 'Head of state and head of government are different roles.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"prime-minister\\\",\\\"executive\\\",\\\"intro\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1336, 'ff540d8c-2e8f-43c6-8251-af6f913a3dc8', 28, 1, 'What does \'federal\' mean in the context of Pakistan\'s political system?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"All power lies with the central government\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Power is divided between central and provincial governments\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"The military controls the government\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"The judiciary runs the state\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'In a federal system, power is distributed between the central (federal) government and provincial governments.', 'Think about how provinces relate to the center.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"federalism\\\",\\\"political-system\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1337, 'cb96a454-8977-4447-a3d3-9d5eb264da75', 28, 1, 'Which principle ensures that each branch of government monitors the others in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Rule of law\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Separation of powers and checks and balances\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Judicial activism\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Parliamentary sovereignty\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The principle of checks and balances ensures each branch monitors the others to prevent abuse of authority.', 'Related to the three branches of government.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"checks-and-balances\\\",\\\"separation-of-powers\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1338, '8c000998-9055-4faf-a65f-11de902a99fe', 28, 1, 'What is the primary function of the Legislature in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Implements laws\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Interprets laws\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Makes laws and approves budget\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Commands armed forces\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The Legislature (Parliament) makes laws, approves the budget, and represents the people.', 'Parliament = law-making body.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"legislature\\\",\\\"parliament\\\",\\\"function\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1339, 'b048848c-43c0-447a-b487-55757c6d5d81', 28, 1, 'Who elects the President of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Directly by the people\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"By the National Assembly alone\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"By an Electoral College of Senate, National Assembly, and Provincial Assemblies\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"By the Prime Minister\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The President is elected by an Electoral College comprising members of the Senate, National Assembly, and four Provincial Assemblies.', 'Multiple houses are involved in this election.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"president\\\",\\\"election\\\",\\\"electoral-college\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '10', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1340, '562fa886-9534-461a-a158-4dabe43bce00', 28, 1, 'What is the term of office for the President of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"3 years\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"4 years\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"5 years\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"6 years\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The President of Pakistan serves a term of 5 years.', 'Same as the National Assembly term.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"president\\\",\\\"term\\\",\\\"office\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '10', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1341, 'dc920a00-dfda-47cf-a867-e5d112a57d39', 28, 1, 'According to Article 41, what is the minimum age requirement to become President of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"35 years\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"40 years\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"45 years\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"50 years\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Article 41 of the Constitution specifies that the President must be at least 45 years of age.', 'Higher age requirement than for MNA.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"president\\\",\\\"eligibility\\\",\\\"article-41\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '11', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1342, '58ef9798-930f-4593-9e5f-8b27c5d1afa6', 28, 1, 'How many consecutive terms can a person serve as President of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"One\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Two\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Three\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Unlimited\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'No person can hold the office of President for more than two consecutive terms.', 'There is a constitutional limit on presidential terms.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"president\\\",\\\"terms\\\",\\\"constitution\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '11', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1343, '9797ead0-ca27-461d-afbe-ca5a6ddb46e3', 28, 1, 'Under Article 89, the President can promulgate Ordinances when:', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Parliament is in session\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Parliament is not in session\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"The Supreme Court approves\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"A national emergency is declared\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Article 89 allows the President to promulgate Ordinances when Parliament is not in session; these must be approved by Parliament within a specified time.', 'Ordinances are temporary laws.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"president\\\",\\\"ordinance\\\",\\\"article-89\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '12', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1344, 'b43a4eca-3f45-4c6c-8c97-de75cf645635', 28, 1, 'Which amendment significantly curtailed the President\'s discretionary powers in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"8th Amendment\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"13th Amendment\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"17th Amendment\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"18th Amendment\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"4\\\"]\"', 'The 18th Amendment (2010) significantly curtailed the President\'s discretionary powers, making the President act on the advice of the Prime Minister in almost all matters.', 'Major constitutional reform in 2010.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"president\\\",\\\"18th-amendment\\\",\\\"powers\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '13', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1345, 'af9943f8-890f-485b-83ba-fef2b96485fd', 28, 1, 'Under Article 45, the President of Pakistan has the power to:', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Dissolve the National Assembly\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Grant pardon or commute sentences\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Appoint the Chief of Army Staff\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Declare war\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Article 45 grants the President the power to grant pardon, reprieve, or respite, and to remit, suspend, or commute any sentence.', 'Think about mercy/clemency powers.', 'hard', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"president\\\",\\\"article-45\\\",\\\"pardon\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '12', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1346, '078e8888-63b6-4be7-a456-151773ae93a1', 28, 1, 'Under which article can the President proclaim emergency if constitutional machinery fails in a province?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Article 232\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Article 234\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Article 235\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Article 245\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Article 234 allows the President to proclaim emergency (Governor\'s Rule) if constitutional machinery fails in a province.', 'Different articles cover different types of emergency.', 'hard', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"president\\\",\\\"emergency\\\",\\\"article-234\\\",\\\"governor-rule\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '12', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1347, '0d9b5c0f-a4b7-4da5-bd34-b6f9d2a2f757', 28, 1, 'Who is the Supreme Commander of the Armed Forces in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Prime Minister\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Chief of Army Staff\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"President\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Chairman Joint Chiefs\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The President of Pakistan is the Supreme Commander of the Armed Forces.', 'A ceremonial but important constitutional role.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"president\\\",\\\"armed-forces\\\",\\\"commander\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '11', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1348, '565f2e17-70c0-4a1b-967c-fbcd8df18df6', 28, 1, 'From which house must the Prime Minister of Pakistan be a member?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Senate\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"National Assembly\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Provincial Assembly\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Joint Parliament\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The Prime Minister must be a member of the National Assembly and a Muslim.', 'The PM is responsible to the lower house.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"prime-minister\\\",\\\"eligibility\\\",\\\"national-assembly\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '15', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1349, '3f968759-1378-4ab1-822c-45cc729ac77b', 28, 1, 'According to Article 91, within how many days must the Prime Minister obtain a vote of confidence from the National Assembly?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"30 days\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"45 days\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"60 days\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"90 days\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'According to Article 91, the Prime Minister must obtain a vote of confidence from the National Assembly within 60 days of taking the oath.', 'This ensures the PM has majority support.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"prime-minister\\\",\\\"vote-of-confidence\\\",\\\"article-91\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '15', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1350, 'bcf4d6bf-a665-4ce1-9d53-521f9b93a21d', 28, 1, 'Who chairs the Cabinet in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"President\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Speaker of National Assembly\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Prime Minister\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Chairman Senate\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The Prime Minister chairs the Cabinet and determines the portfolio of federal ministers.', 'The PM is the head of government.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"prime-minister\\\",\\\"cabinet\\\",\\\"chair\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '16', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1351, 'a4938d77-c44a-418a-832e-613cb6e2c44a', 28, 1, 'Which committee is headed by the Prime Minister for economic coordination?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Cabinet Committee on Energy\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Economic Coordination Committee (ECC)\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Cabinet Committee on Privatization\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"National Economic Council\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The Prime Minister is the head of the Economic Coordination Committee (ECC).', 'Important body for economic decisions.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"prime-minister\\\",\\\"ECC\\\",\\\"economic-coordination\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '16', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1352, 'de0a89b7-47da-47d3-808d-686bf819ffd8', 28, 1, 'The Prime Minister of Pakistan determines foreign policy in consultation with:', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"The President only\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"The Supreme Court\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"The Cabinet\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"The Army Chief\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The Prime Minister determines the foreign policy of Pakistan in consultation with the Cabinet.', 'Foreign policy is a collective Cabinet decision.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"prime-minister\\\",\\\"foreign-policy\\\",\\\"cabinet\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '17', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1353, 'b021eedc-507f-400e-81c5-cf0a4cc2f9b6', 28, 1, 'Who cannot be removed by the President unless they lose the confidence of the National Assembly?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Chief Justice\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Prime Minister\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Chairman Senate\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Attorney General\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The President cannot remove the Prime Minister unless the Prime Minister has lost the confidence of the National Assembly.', 'The PM is accountable to Parliament, not the President.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"prime-minister\\\",\\\"removal\\\",\\\"confidence\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '15', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
(1354, 'c0b67b0c-ed31-4efa-80c7-6d5ae205b9c4', 28, 1, 'What does \'Collective Responsibility\' of the Cabinet mean under Article 91?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Each minister is responsible individually\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"The Cabinet is collectively responsible to the National Assembly\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"The President holds ministers accountable\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Provinces share cabinet responsibility\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Article 91 establishes that the Cabinet is collectively responsible to the National Assembly; if a no-confidence vote passes against one minister, the entire cabinet falls.', 'All ministers stand or fall together.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"cabinet\\\",\\\"collective-responsibility\\\",\\\"article-91\\\"]\"', 'Constitution of Pakistan 1973 & Political System of Pakistan', '19', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:29:30', '2026-04-30 19:29:30'),
