(1404, 'b482ea0f-fd5c-4d97-a5a3-28b7a87002fa', 29, 1, 'Pakistan is ranked which number in terms of land area among the countries of the world?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"25th\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"29th\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"33rd\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"40th\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan is the 33rd largest country in the world by total area (796,096 sq km).', 'Think mid-thirties range.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"pakistan\\\",\\\"area\\\",\\\"world-ranking\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1405, '44fd0561-5812-4099-ab2c-e8bbe65b2331', 29, 1, 'Pakistan is located at the crossroads of which three regions?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Europe, Asia, Africa\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"South Asia, Central Asia, and the Middle East\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"South Asia, East Asia, and Central Asia\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Middle East, Africa, and South Asia\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan\'s strategic location at the crossroads of South Asia, Central Asia, and the Middle East gives it significant geopolitical importance.', 'Think about neighboring regions strategically.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"pakistan\\\",\\\"location\\\",\\\"geopolitics\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1406, '719f453c-4c8b-45ca-8d3f-9c582a606cc3', 29, 1, 'What is the capital of Balochistan province?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Turbat\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Gwadar\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Quetta\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Khuzdar\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Quetta is the capital of Balochistan, the largest province of Pakistan by area.', 'Quetta is also called the \"Fruit Garden of Pakistan\".', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"balochistan\\\",\\\"capital\\\",\\\"quetta\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1407, '84835203-0e60-45f7-bc39-f8570bce8299', 29, 1, 'Which province is the largest by area in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Punjab\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Sindh\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Khyber Pakhtunkhwa\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Balochistan\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"4\\\"]\"', 'Balochistan is the largest province by area, covering approximately 44% of Pakistan\'s total land area.', 'Despite its huge size, it has the smallest population.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"balochistan\\\",\\\"largest-province\\\",\\\"area\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1408, '59b8b95e-8e18-4fe9-acda-14a8a92f8f4b', 29, 1, 'Which province is the most populous in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Sindh\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Punjab\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Khyber Pakhtunkhwa\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Balochistan\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Punjab is the most populous province, home to more than half of the country\'s population (110 million+).', 'Punjab means \"Land of Five Rivers\".', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"punjab\\\",\\\"population\\\",\\\"most-populous\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1409, '8ef56cd0-3a0b-47bc-b906-efcfa2c67b2f', 29, 1, 'What does the name \'Punjab\' mean?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Land of rivers\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Land of five rivers\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Land of three rivers\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Land of water\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Punjab comes from the Persian words \"Panj\" (five) and \"Aab\" (water), meaning \"Land of Five Rivers\".', 'Panj = five, Aab = water in Persian.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"punjab\\\",\\\"name\\\",\\\"meaning\\\",\\\"five-rivers\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1410, '94b2b2b1-9c5e-43ea-8539-b3d672ffed12', 29, 1, 'What is the capital of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa province?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Mingora\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Abbottabad\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Peshawar\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Mardan\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Peshawar is the capital of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa (KP) province.', 'Peshawar is also called \"City on the Frontier\".', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"KP\\\",\\\"khyber-pakhtunkhwa\\\",\\\"capital\\\",\\\"peshawar\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1411, '060b5b0f-e72a-458f-8a62-a68ce382b8a1', 29, 1, 'Through which constitutional amendment was NWFP renamed to Khyber Pakhtunkhwa?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"13th Amendment\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"17th Amendment\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"18th Amendment\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"25th Amendment\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The North-West Frontier Province (NWFP) was renamed Khyber Pakhtunkhwa through the 18th Amendment in 2010.', 'The 18th Amendment made many major changes in 2010.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"KP\\\",\\\"18th-amendment\\\",\\\"NWFP\\\",\\\"renamed\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1412, '5b86d55c-b549-49b3-a88c-a3bf1e35582b', 29, 1, 'Through which amendment were the former FATA districts merged with Khyber Pakhtunkhwa?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"18th Amendment\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"21st Amendment\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"25th Amendment\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"26th Amendment\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The former Federally Administered Tribal Areas (FATA) were merged with KP under the 25th Amendment in 2018, adding 7 new districts.', 'FATA merger happened in 2018.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"KP\\\",\\\"FATA\\\",\\\"25th-amendment\\\",\\\"merged-districts\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1413, 'f66eb1e8-fbb2-4c31-8145-81dac62683bc', 29, 1, 'Approximately what percentage of Pakistan\'s total area does Balochistan cover?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"25%\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"35%\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"44%\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"55%\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Balochistan covers approximately 44% of Pakistan\'s total land area, making it the largest province.', 'Nearly half of Pakistan\'s land.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"balochistan\\\",\\\"area-percentage\\\",\\\"44\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
(1414, 'd74945b4-8f2c-4442-a3f6-3878e6e253cf', 29, 1, 'Which city is the capital of Azad Jammu & Kashmir (AJK)?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Mirpur\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Kotli\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Rawalakot\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Muzaffarabad\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"4\\\"]\"', 'Muzaffarabad is the capital of Azad Jammu & Kashmir (AJK).', '\"Azad\" means \"liberated\" in Urdu.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"AJK\\\",\\\"azad-kashmir\\\",\\\"capital\\\",\\\"muzaffarabad\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '5', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:49', '2026-04-30 19:43:49'),
