(1442, 'd8be9ea6-4e14-4085-853f-4c4033c20604', 29, 1, 'Nanga Parbat is nicknamed which of the following?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Savage Mountain\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Killer Mountain\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Naked Mountain\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Hidden Peak\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Nanga Parbat is nicknamed the \"Killer Mountain\" due to the high number of deaths in early climbing attempts. It is also called \"Naked Mountain.\"', 'It has a very deadly climbing history.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"nanga-parbat\\\",\\\"killer-mountain\\\",\\\"nickname\\\",\\\"himalayas\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '18', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:50', '2026-04-30 19:43:50'),
