(1449, '5e917da4-4a76-487e-8c3b-be88c6762dca', 29, 1, 'Pakistan is called the \'Third Pole\' because of its:', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Extreme cold temperatures\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Largest number of glaciers outside polar regions\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Location near the North Pole\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"High altitude deserts\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan has more glaciers than any other country outside the polar regions, earning it the nickname \"Third Pole.\"', 'Think ice and glaciers, not temperature.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"pakistan\\\",\\\"third-pole\\\",\\\"glaciers\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '21', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:50', '2026-04-30 19:43:50'),
