(1460, '1919d8d4-8ea0-43e1-ba97-eb699eaae965', 29, 1, 'What does \'Ansoo\' mean in Urdu, referring to Ansoo Lake?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Mountain\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Cloud\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Tear\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Star\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Ansoo means \"tear\" in Urdu. Ansoo Lake is named for its teardrop shape and is located at 4,245 meters elevation in Kaghan Valley.', 'The lake looks like a teardrop from above.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"ansoo-lake\\\",\\\"tear\\\",\\\"urdu\\\",\\\"kaghan-valley\\\",\\\"elevation\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '26', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:50', '2026-04-30 19:43:50'),
