(1474, '712ed1ba-e35d-4c48-8000-62523caa7386', 29, 1, 'Which dam, currently under construction on the Indus River, will generate 4,500 MW?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Mohmand Dam\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Kalabagh Dam\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Basha Dam (Diamer-Bhasha)\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Dasu Dam\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The Diamer-Bhasha Dam (Basha Dam), under construction on the Indus River, will generate 4,500 MW of hydroelectric power.', 'Major infrastructure project on the Indus.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"diamer-bhasha-dam\\\",\\\"indus\\\",\\\"4500MW\\\",\\\"hydropower\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '35', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:50', '2026-04-30 19:43:50'),
(1475, '0e8db530-9847-40bc-a8a3-02ebfc1384bc', 29, 1, 'Which province has Pakistan\'s largest solar power project, the Quaid-e-Azam Solar Park?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Sindh\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Khyber Pakhtunkhwa\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Balochistan\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Punjab\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"4\\\"]\"', 'The Quaid-e-Azam Solar Park is located in Bahawalpur, Punjab, and is one of Pakistan\'s largest renewable energy projects.', 'Named after Pakistan\'s founder.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"quaid-e-azam-solar-park\\\",\\\"bahawalpur\\\",\\\"punjab\\\",\\\"solar-energy\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '35', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:50', '2026-04-30 19:43:50');
