(1476, 'cf895f4c-27b5-4687-b8ff-183b75432c25', 29, 1, 'Pakistan\'s coastline along the Arabian Sea is approximately how long?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"600 km\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"800 km\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"1,046 km\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"1,200 km\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan has a coastline of approximately 1,046 km along the Arabian Sea, with major fishing ports at Karachi, Gwadar, and Pasni.', 'Stretches from Karachi to Gwadar and beyond.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"pakistan\\\",\\\"coastline\\\",\\\"1046km\\\",\\\"arabian-sea\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '35', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:50', '2026-04-30 19:43:50'),
(1477, '8107b821-d481-4ed5-8e57-a21ae59bede3', 29, 1, 'Which type of forest is found in the Ziarat area of Balochistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Mangrove forest\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Coniferous forest\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Juniper forest\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Riverine forest\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Ziarat in Balochistan is famous for its juniper forests, which are among the oldest in the world.', 'Ziarat junipers are ancient and unique.', 'hard', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"ziarat\\\",\\\"juniper-forest\\\",\\\"balochistan\\\",\\\"natural-resource\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '34', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:50', '2026-04-30 19:43:50'),
(1478, 'fdd355fb-fcc8-4f59-ad38-3da5b2709b77', 29, 1, 'Where is Pakistan\'s largest nuclear power plant, KANUPP, located?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Chashma, Punjab\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Multan, Punjab\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Karachi, Sindh\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Islamabad, ICT\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'KANUPP (Karachi Nuclear Power Plant) is located in Karachi, Sindh, and is Pakistan\'s first nuclear power plant.', 'Located in Pakistan\'s largest city.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"KANUPP\\\",\\\"karachi\\\",\\\"nuclear-power\\\",\\\"sindh\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '35', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:50', '2026-04-30 19:43:50'),
(1479, 'd9776246-acee-4b7e-bd16-cea2e5b32c46', 29, 1, 'Which project is developing coal mining and power generation in the Thar Desert?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Reko Diq Project\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Saindak Copper Project\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Thar Coal Project\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"CPEC Energy Project\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The Thar Coal Project is developing coal mining and coal-fired power plants in the Thar Desert of Sindh to utilize Pakistan\'s vast coal reserves.', 'Thar has 175 billion tons of coal.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"thar-coal-project\\\",\\\"sindh\\\",\\\"energy\\\",\\\"development\\\"]\"', 'Geography of Pakistan - Comprehensive Study Guide', '35', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:43:50', '2026-04-30 19:43:50'),
(1480, '057eee0f-f192-41f1-b8ee-cda2d246eda1', 30, 1, 'What is considered the backbone of Pakistan\'s economy?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Industry\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Services\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Agriculture\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Banking\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Agriculture is considered the backbone of Pakistan\'s economy. It provides food, raw materials, employment, and contributes significantly to national income and exports.', 'Think about what sector employs the most people in rural Pakistan.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Agriculture\\\",\\\"Pakistan Economy\\\",\\\"Backbone\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1481, 'f8ed2d01-758b-4d39-8f90-fba7f81771ed', 30, 1, 'Which river is the main source of irrigation water for Pakistan\'s agriculture?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Jhelum River\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Chenab River\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Ravi River\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Indus River\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"4\\\"]\"', 'The Indus River and its tributaries provide water for irrigation through canals, making Pakistan one of the largest irrigated agricultural systems in the world.', 'This river gives its name to the entire Indian subcontinent.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Indus River\\\",\\\"Irrigation\\\",\\\"Pakistan Agriculture\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1482, '55777923-d38a-44c9-9b9c-74ba998c232d', 30, 1, 'Which crop is considered the most important food crop in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Rice\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Maize\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Wheat\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Sugarcane\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Wheat is the most important food crop in Pakistan and serves as the staple food of the population.', 'This is the grain used to make roti and bread — the staple food of Pakistanis.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Wheat\\\",\\\"Food Crop\\\",\\\"Pakistan Agriculture\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1483, 'a602ab7c-c006-4099-90bd-90278e548114', 30, 1, 'Which rice variety from Pakistan is famous worldwide for its quality and fragrance?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Irri Rice\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Super Kernel\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Basmati Rice\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Brown Rice\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Basmati rice is Pakistan\'s famous export variety, known worldwide for its distinctive quality, fragrance, and long grain.', 'This variety\'s name means \'full of fragrance\' in Sanskrit.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Basmati Rice\\\",\\\"Export\\\",\\\"Pakistan Agriculture\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1484, '0d6375dd-f46f-4bae-bcbc-bc28713d732f', 30, 1, 'Why is cotton known as \'white gold\' in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Because it is expensive like gold\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Because it is the main raw material for the textile industry\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Because it is exported in large quantities\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Because it grows in white color only\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Cotton is called \'white gold\' because it is the primary raw material for Pakistan\'s textile industry — the largest industrial sector — making it extremely valuable to the economy.', 'Think about which industry relies most heavily on cotton.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Cotton\\\",\\\"White Gold\\\",\\\"Textile Industry\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1485, 'fd7f60b1-f70e-42b3-a279-b65d8cff8a8b', 30, 1, 'What is sugarcane mainly used to produce in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Cooking oil\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Sugar and by-products\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Animal feed only\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Textile fiber\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Sugarcane is used in the production of sugar and other by-products in Pakistan. Many sugar mills in Punjab and Sindh process sugarcane.', 'Sugar mills are the main industrial users of this crop.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Sugarcane\\\",\\\"Sugar Industry\\\",\\\"Pakistan Agriculture\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1486, 'd637ea02-47c4-4b59-b354-1258f26f2444', 30, 1, 'Which of the following is NOT listed as a major crop of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Wheat\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Rice\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Tobacco\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Cotton\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The major crops of Pakistan listed in the document are wheat, rice, cotton, sugarcane, and maize. Tobacco is not listed among the major crops.', 'Review the five major crops: wheat, rice, cotton, sugarcane, and maize.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Major Crops\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Agriculture\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1487, 'ecc64222-a84d-46a3-a361-f391308e2f50', 30, 1, 'Which fruit is NOT among the important fruits produced in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Mangoes\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Oranges\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Pineapples\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Dates\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The document lists mangoes, oranges, apples, bananas, and dates as important fruits. Pineapples are not listed as a major fruit produced in Pakistan.', 'Pineapples require a tropical climate different from most of Pakistan.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Fruits\\\",\\\"Pakistan Agriculture\\\",\\\"Horticulture\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1488, '2653718f-260e-4dee-a3d0-2ca185b62977', 30, 1, 'What do livestock animals mainly provide in Pakistan\'s agricultural economy?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only milk and meat\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Meat, milk, leather, wool, and other products\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Only transportation\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Only eggs and wool\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan\'s livestock sector provides meat, milk, leather, wool, and other products. It also contributes significantly to agricultural economy and rural employment.', 'Livestock has multiple economic uses beyond just food production.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Livestock\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Agricultural Economy\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1489, '854d16dc-a094-4ceb-aa03-5498b2aae9c5', 30, 1, 'Which sector is supported by agricultural raw materials like cotton and sugarcane?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Banking and finance\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Mining and energy\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Textile mills, sugar mills, and food processing\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Construction and cement\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Agriculture supports industries such as textile mills (using cotton), sugar mills (using sugarcane), and food processing industries that rely on agricultural raw materials.', 'Raw materials link agriculture to manufacturing industries.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Agriculture\\\",\\\"Industry\\\",\\\"Raw Materials\\\",\\\"Textile\\\",\\\"Sugar\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1490, '161033f6-a5fe-426b-b294-aa2b4b2bfff1', 30, 1, 'What percentage of Pakistan\'s population lives in rural areas and depends on farming?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"A small minority\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"About half\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"A large portion\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Almost none\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'According to the document, a large portion of Pakistan\'s population lives in rural areas and depends on farming for their livelihood.', 'Pakistan is still predominantly a rural society.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Rural Population\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Farming\\\",\\\"Agriculture\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1491, '95d9935d-19df-473c-8abc-b5cd3762c5f1', 30, 1, 'Pakistan\'s irrigation system is based primarily on which network?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Underground tube wells only\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Rainwater harvesting only\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Canal system fed by the Indus and its tributaries\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Desalination plants\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan\'s extensive canal network, fed by the Indus River and its tributaries, makes it one of the largest irrigated agricultural systems in the world.', 'Canals distribute river water across agricultural land.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Irrigation\\\",\\\"Canal System\\\",\\\"Indus\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1492, 'b320a102-a72b-49a8-b4a6-b83e4def0551', 30, 1, 'Which is the largest industry in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Sugar industry\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Cement industry\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Automobile industry\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Textile industry\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"4\\\"]\"', 'The textile industry is the largest industry in Pakistan, based mainly on cotton production and including spinning, weaving, dyeing, and garment manufacturing.', 'This industry is built around Pakistan\'s \'white gold\' — cotton.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Textile Industry\\\",\\\"Largest Industry\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1493, '130248ab-1597-4d5d-ab5d-4e348f104b72', 30, 1, 'Which city in Pakistan is especially famous for its sports goods and surgical instruments industries?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Lahore\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Karachi\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Faisalabad\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Sialkot\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"4\\\"]\"', 'Sialkot is internationally renowned for producing footballs, cricket bats, hockey sticks, and other sports equipment, as well as surgical instruments exported worldwide.', 'This city in Punjab is a global hub for two very specific export industries.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Sialkot\\\",\\\"Sports Goods\\\",\\\"Surgical Instruments\\\",\\\"Industry\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1494, '181bee5f-3a19-4a73-8403-89f7ea3fe4e2', 30, 1, 'What is the main function of the cement industry in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Producing fertilizers for crops\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Supporting construction of houses, roads, bridges, and dams\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Manufacturing chemicals\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Processing food products\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The cement industry is crucial for the construction sector — providing material for building houses, roads, bridges, dams, and other infrastructure projects.', 'Construction projects cannot proceed without this key material.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Cement Industry\\\",\\\"Construction\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1495, '1a8a3f7f-8a10-4f6f-8e55-f1c954186a50', 30, 1, 'What does the fertilizer industry in Pakistan primarily help to achieve?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Processing raw cotton\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Improving agricultural productivity and increasing crop yields\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Purifying water for drinking\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Manufacturing chemicals for export\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The fertilizer industry produces fertilizers that provide essential nutrients to crops, helping farmers improve agricultural productivity and increase crop yields.', 'Fertilizers compensate for missing nutrients in soil.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Fertilizer Industry\\\",\\\"Agriculture\\\",\\\"Crop Yield\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1496, 'f5728c60-d5b0-4e9b-a50f-9afc43dadd38', 30, 1, 'Which products of Pakistan\'s textile industry are among its largest exports?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Rice and mangoes\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Cotton yarn, cloth, garments, and textile items\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Sports goods and surgical instruments\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Petroleum and chemicals\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Textile products including cotton yarn, cloth, garments, and other textile items are among Pakistan\'s largest exports, generated by the largest industrial sector.', 'The textile industry\'s output directly feeds into Pakistan\'s export earnings.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Textile Exports\\\",\\\"Cotton Yarn\\\",\\\"Garments\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1497, '0afee28b-736d-41f4-9aa4-8a86f09d4d3e', 30, 1, 'The sugar industry in Pakistan is mainly located in which provinces?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"KPK and Balochistan\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Gilgit-Baltistan and AJK\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Punjab and Sindh\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Sindh and KPK\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Many sugar mills are located in Punjab and Sindh because these provinces are the main sugarcane cultivating regions of Pakistan.', 'Sugarcane grows best in warm and humid conditions found in these two provinces.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Sugar Industry\\\",\\\"Punjab\\\",\\\"Sindh\\\",\\\"Sugarcane\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1498, '2c129b3f-d21a-4436-aebf-4aca6128e8df', 30, 1, 'What does the automobile industry in Pakistan primarily produce?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only motorcycles\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Only tractors\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Cars, motorcycles, tractors, and other vehicles\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Ships and aircraft\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan\'s automobile industry assembles cars, motorcycles, tractors, and other vehicles, supporting transportation and agricultural activities while providing employment.', 'This industry serves both personal transport and agricultural needs.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Automobile Industry\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Cars\\\",\\\"Motorcycles\\\",\\\"Tractors\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1499, 'cbb3d975-23ba-4dd3-a6ba-114a224c8b95', 30, 1, 'Sports goods produced in Sialkot include which of the following?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Tennis rackets and golf clubs only\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Footballs, cricket bats, hockey sticks, and other equipment\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Boxing gloves only\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Swimming gear only\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Sialkot produces footballs, cricket bats, hockey sticks, and other sports equipment that are exported to many countries worldwide.', 'Sialkot is known internationally for these sporting goods exports.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Sialkot\\\",\\\"Sports Goods\\\",\\\"Football\\\",\\\"Cricket\\\",\\\"Hockey\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1500, 'f7c77658-d167-44a0-9985-6c377eb360a6', 30, 1, 'What type of instruments manufactured in Sialkot are used in hospitals worldwide?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Electronic diagnostic instruments\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Musical instruments\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Surgical instruments\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Scientific laboratory instruments\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Sialkot is a global center for manufacturing surgical instruments — medical tools used in hospitals and surgical procedures around the world.', 'This makes Sialkot important to global healthcare supply chains.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Sialkot\\\",\\\"Surgical Instruments\\\",\\\"Medical\\\",\\\"Export\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1501, 'cd1a4366-0238-4389-9f7a-134e3e9e2a7d', 30, 1, 'How does industrial development contribute to Pakistan\'s economy?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only by creating pollution\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"By increasing production, encouraging technological advancement, and promoting exports\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Only by providing government revenue\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Only by reducing agriculture\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Industrial development contributes to Pakistan\'s economy by increasing production, encouraging technological advancement, and promoting exports — all of which strengthen national economic growth.', 'Industry transforms raw materials into value-added products.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Industrial Development\\\",\\\"Pakistan Economy\\\",\\\"Production\\\",\\\"Exports\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1502, '29ecf548-f543-4d42-b7a7-e18e8b9fad28', 30, 1, 'The textile industry in Pakistan involves which processes?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only garment stitching\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Spinning, weaving, dyeing, and garment manufacturing\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Only dyeing and printing\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Only cotton picking and cleaning\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan\'s textile industry is a complete value chain involving spinning (making yarn), weaving (making cloth), dyeing (adding color), and garment manufacturing (final products).', 'This is a full production chain from raw cotton to finished clothing.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Textile Industry\\\",\\\"Spinning\\\",\\\"Weaving\\\",\\\"Dyeing\\\",\\\"Garments\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1503, 'a6fbb819-974b-4b6f-9744-60dc85e5c204', 30, 1, 'What are the largest exports of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Petroleum products\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Sports goods and surgical instruments\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Textile products\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Machinery and vehicles\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Textile products are the largest exports of Pakistan, including cotton yarn, cloth, garments, and other textile items that generate the most foreign exchange earnings.', 'The largest industry naturally produces the largest exports.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Textile\\\",\\\"Largest Export\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Foreign Exchange\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1504, '6b2878b2-45db-4598-b16c-dd8805fb24f6', 30, 1, 'Why does Pakistan import petroleum and oil products?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"To re-export at profit\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Because local production is insufficient for energy needs in transportation, electricity, and industries\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"To store as strategic reserves only\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Because petroleum is cheaper abroad\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan imports petroleum and oil products because local production is insufficient to meet the country\'s energy demands for transportation, electricity generation, and industries.', 'Pakistan\'s domestic oil production meets only a fraction of its needs.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Petroleum\\\",\\\"Oil Imports\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Energy\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1505, '458e81a9-06b8-46da-9c65-ab559a82112a', 30, 1, 'Which Sialkot products are important in Pakistan\'s export earnings?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Textile products and rice\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Sports goods and surgical instruments\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Cement and fertilizers\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Fruits and vegetables\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Sports goods (footballs, cricket bats, hockey sticks) and surgical instruments manufactured in Sialkot are important contributors to Pakistan\'s export earnings.', 'Two specialized industries make this city uniquely important for exports.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Sialkot\\\",\\\"Sports Goods\\\",\\\"Surgical Instruments\\\",\\\"Exports\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1506, '69f64f6a-327f-48ba-ae2a-263b2dcb5862', 30, 1, 'What is the purpose of exporting goods for Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"To reduce domestic consumption\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"To generate foreign exchange earnings\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"To control inflation\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"To reduce unemployment only\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan exports goods to generate foreign exchange earnings, which are then used to pay for imports and maintain economic stability.', 'Exports bring in foreign currency that funds imports.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Exports\\\",\\\"Foreign Exchange\\\",\\\"Pakistan Economy\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1507, '183181a4-a326-4c89-b900-a7d37489a01e', 30, 1, 'Which of the following is an important export crop of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Wheat\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Maize\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Basmati Rice\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Sugarcane\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Basmati rice is an important export crop for Pakistan, famous worldwide for its distinctive quality and fragrance, earning valuable foreign exchange.', 'Among Pakistan\'s crops, this one is especially valued in international markets.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Basmati Rice\\\",\\\"Export Crop\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1508, '2df2f535-276d-423a-bde0-064285cc8e5f', 30, 1, 'What are the key imported items by Pakistan other than petroleum?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Rice and wheat\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Machinery, vehicles, chemicals, edible oil, electronic goods, and medicines\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Sports goods and surgical instruments\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Cotton and textiles\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Besides petroleum, Pakistan imports machinery and equipment, vehicles, chemicals, edible oil, electronic goods, and medicines to support industry and meet domestic demand.', 'These imports support industrial growth and daily needs.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Imports\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Machinery\\\",\\\"Chemicals\\\",\\\"Electronics\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1509, 'ab769b4d-4e75-477a-924d-ec28bb32eabe', 30, 1, 'What is the balance of trade?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Total amount of taxes collected\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"The balance between a country\'s exports and imports\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Total foreign reserves\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Annual GDP growth rate\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The balance of trade is the difference between a country\'s exports and imports. A positive balance means more exports than imports, which strengthens the economy.', 'When exports exceed imports, a country has a trade surplus.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Balance of Trade\\\",\\\"Exports\\\",\\\"Imports\\\",\\\"Economy\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1510, '49068a64-f7fe-441e-a22c-cea527922279', 30, 1, 'Which agricultural products are included in Pakistan\'s exports?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only wheat and maize\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Rice, fruits, vegetables, and seafood\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Only cotton and sugarcane\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Only mangoes\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan\'s agricultural exports include rice (especially Basmati), fruits, vegetables, and seafood, in addition to manufactured goods like textile and leather products.', 'Pakistan exports a diverse range of agricultural produce.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Agricultural Exports\\\",\\\"Rice\\\",\\\"Fruits\\\",\\\"Seafood\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1511, '0c9442f1-28c8-40e1-b200-b67b6752bb46', 30, 1, 'Why is increasing exports important for Pakistan\'s economy?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only to show economic strength\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"To earn foreign currency used to pay for imports and maintain stability\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Only to create jobs abroad\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"To reduce domestic consumption\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Increasing exports helps Pakistan earn more foreign currency, which is essential for paying for imports and maintaining economic and financial stability.', 'More exports mean more foreign exchange earnings for the country.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Exports\\\",\\\"Foreign Currency\\\",\\\"Economic Stability\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1512, 'd70b4a6e-d8e3-483d-a01d-b2f82278ea34', 30, 1, 'Leather goods and carpets are categorized under which sector of Pakistan\'s economy?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Agriculture\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Imports\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Exports\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Banking\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Leather goods and carpets are among Pakistan\'s export products that help earn foreign currency, along with textiles, rice, sports goods, fruits, and seafood.', 'These are value-added products made from local raw materials and sold abroad.', 'hard', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Leather Goods\\\",\\\"Carpets\\\",\\\"Exports\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1513, 'fb41a3b7-b650-4ce4-aea5-c33ce573abf2', 30, 1, 'What is the central bank of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"National Bank of Pakistan\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Habib Bank Limited\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"State Bank of Pakistan\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Pakistan Stock Exchange\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The State Bank of Pakistan is the central bank responsible for regulating the banking system, controlling monetary policy, issuing currency, and managing foreign exchange reserves.', 'Every country has a central bank — this is Pakistan\'s.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"State Bank of Pakistan\\\",\\\"Central Bank\\\",\\\"Banking System\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1514, '9dda3c45-1b58-4fbc-a0ef-adc8e2656160', 30, 1, 'Which of the following is a major commercial bank in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Pakistan Stock Exchange\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Meezan Bank\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"State Bank of Pakistan\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Insurance Corporation\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Meezan Bank is a major commercial bank in Pakistan. Other major ones include National Bank of Pakistan, Habib Bank Limited, and United Bank Limited.', 'Commercial banks operate under supervision of the State Bank.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Meezan Bank\\\",\\\"Commercial Bank\\\",\\\"Pakistan Banking\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1515, 'dea020c4-958e-4fc0-98e5-6d928b547644', 30, 1, 'What is the primary function of the State Bank of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only to accept deposits\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Regulating the banking system, monetary policy, currency issuance, and managing foreign exchange\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Providing microfinance only\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Investing in the stock market\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The State Bank of Pakistan regulates the banking system, controls monetary policy, issues currency notes, supervises commercial banks, and manages foreign exchange reserves.', 'As a central bank, it oversees the entire financial system.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"State Bank of Pakistan\\\",\\\"Functions\\\",\\\"Monetary Policy\\\",\\\"Currency\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1516, '78e36932-1e7c-4875-af9c-a271cd0c4887', 30, 1, 'What role does the Pakistan Stock Exchange play in the financial system?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Printing currency notes\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Regulating insurance companies\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Allowing companies to raise capital through sale of shares\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Providing microfinance to small businesses\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The Pakistan Stock Exchange allows companies to raise capital by selling shares to investors. Investors buy and sell shares, helping companies fund their growth.', 'Stock markets connect companies needing capital with investors.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Pakistan Stock Exchange\\\",\\\"Shares\\\",\\\"Capital\\\",\\\"Investment\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1517, '82e904d5-cd67-44f4-b548-4231eea40294', 30, 1, 'Which institutions provide financial support to small businesses and low-income individuals?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Central banks\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Insurance companies only\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Microfinance banks\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Commercial banks only\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Microfinance banks specifically provide financial support to small businesses and low-income individuals who may not qualify for regular commercial bank loans.', 'Microfinance focuses on small-scale lending to the underserved.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Microfinance\\\",\\\"Small Business\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Financial Inclusion\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1518, '624c05cc-4f02-426f-ac0e-0810d5588cdb', 30, 1, 'What are commercial banks primarily responsible for in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Issuing currency\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Controlling monetary policy\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Accepting deposits, providing loans, facilitating trade, and supporting economic growth\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Printing money and regulating insurance\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Commercial banks in Pakistan accept deposits from customers, provide loans to individuals and businesses, facilitate trade, and support overall economic growth.', 'These are the everyday banks that ordinary people and businesses use.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Commercial Banks\\\",\\\"Deposits\\\",\\\"Loans\\\",\\\"Pakistan Banking\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1519, 'a674255b-b0c7-41cd-8e69-6b081af7666d', 30, 1, 'How does the banking system help the economy function?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"By reducing imports\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"By mobilizing savings, encouraging investment, and promoting economic development\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"By controlling inflation through price fixing\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"By managing foreign trade agreements\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The banking and financial system helps mobilize savings, encourage investment, and promote economic development by ensuring the smooth flow of money across all economic activities.', 'Banks channel money from savers to investors and businesses.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Banking System\\\",\\\"Savings\\\",\\\"Investment\\\",\\\"Economic Development\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1520, '20791739-8542-4ee6-9bd4-c2902c17f843', 30, 1, 'Which of the following is NOT a function of the State Bank of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Issuing currency notes\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Supervising commercial banks\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Directly selling shares in the stock market\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Managing foreign exchange reserves\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The State Bank of Pakistan does not directly sell shares in the stock market. Its functions are currency issuance, supervising banks, controlling monetary policy, and managing foreign exchange.', 'The State Bank regulates — it does not engage in stock market trading.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"State Bank Pakistan\\\",\\\"Functions\\\",\\\"Currency\\\",\\\"Monetary Policy\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1521, 'b54920ba-6e8a-4a1f-b344-20461b440990', 30, 1, 'The Pakistan Stock Exchange allows investors to do which of the following?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Deposit savings in accounts\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Apply for bank loans\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Buy and sell shares of companies\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Exchange foreign currency\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The Pakistan Stock Exchange is a marketplace where investors can buy and sell shares (stocks) of listed companies, helping companies raise capital and investors earn returns.', 'Stock markets are where company ownership stakes are traded.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Pakistan Stock Exchange\\\",\\\"Buy\\\",\\\"Sell\\\",\\\"Shares\\\",\\\"Investors\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1522, '38f11692-d3d2-43b2-b534-d0d894f220a7', 30, 1, 'Which institutions besides banks are part of Pakistan\'s financial system?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only agricultural cooperatives\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Insurance companies, investment firms, and microfinance banks\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Only the government treasury\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Only the State Bank\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan\'s financial system includes not just banks but also insurance companies, investment firms, and microfinance banks that collectively provide comprehensive financial services.', 'A financial system is broader than just commercial banks.', 'hard', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Financial System\\\",\\\"Insurance\\\",\\\"Investment\\\",\\\"Microfinance\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '4', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1523, '538c57a1-c609-4dbd-b872-52090b20f43c', 30, 1, 'Pakistan\'s economy is best described as:', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"A developed economy\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"A developing economy based on agriculture, industry, services, trade, and financial institutions\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"A purely agricultural economy\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"An industrial economy\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan has a developing economy based on a mix of agriculture, industry, services, trade, and financial institutions that together drive employment and economic growth.', 'Developing economies are in the process of growing and industrializing.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Pakistan Economy\\\",\\\"Developing Economy\\\",\\\"Overview\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1524, '71380f35-26d1-4b0c-82dd-bf972bb2347c', 30, 1, 'What are the main pillars of Pakistan\'s economy mentioned in the document?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only agriculture and industry\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Agriculture, industrial production, international trade, and banking and financial system\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Only trade and services\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Industry, military, and foreign aid\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan\'s economy depends mainly on four pillars: agriculture, industrial production, international trade, and the banking and financial system — all playing roles in economic growth.', 'These four sectors together drive Pakistan\'s GDP and employment.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Pakistan Economy\\\",\\\"Agriculture\\\",\\\"Industry\\\",\\\"Trade\\\",\\\"Banking\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1525, 'bfc5316c-80a0-4f5f-8f58-00dfa42a2be1', 30, 1, 'What is the purpose of international trade for Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only to compete with neighboring countries\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"To sell surplus products and purchase goods that cannot be produced locally\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"To achieve self-sufficiency\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Only to earn prestige internationally\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'International trade allows Pakistan to sell surplus products (exports) and purchase goods it cannot produce locally or in sufficient quantities (imports), benefiting the overall economy.', 'Trade fills the gap between what a country produces and what it needs.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"International Trade\\\",\\\"Exports\\\",\\\"Imports\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '3', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1526, '9f1c60de-cd75-4ad0-b86b-41c5f5bc48fc', 30, 1, 'Which sector creates employment while increasing production and strengthening the national economy?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only agriculture\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Only banking\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Industrial sector\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Only the services sector\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'Industrial development increases production, creates employment opportunities, and strengthens the national economy by processing raw materials into finished goods for domestic use and export.', 'Industries multiply the value of raw materials and create jobs.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Industrial Sector\\\",\\\"Employment\\\",\\\"Production\\\",\\\"Pakistan Economy\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '2', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1527, 'bd3f7f25-d52f-4937-bd5d-d2c16f4c3ad0', 30, 1, 'What role does agriculture play in supporting Pakistan\'s industries?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"It competes with industries\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"It provides raw materials to industries like textile mills, sugar mills, and food processing\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"It replaces industrial production\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"It only provides food and nothing else\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Agriculture provides essential raw materials — cotton for textile mills, sugarcane for sugar mills, and crops for food processing — making it the foundation of many Pakistani industries.', 'Industry and agriculture are interconnected in Pakistan\'s economy.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Agriculture\\\",\\\"Industry\\\",\\\"Raw Materials\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1528, '438dbf54-42a3-4883-a9a0-7696d917e55f', 30, 1, 'How does improving living standards relate to economic activities in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Living standards are unrelated to economy\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Economic activities like production, distribution, and consumption contribute to improving living standards\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Only exports improve living standards\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Only banking improves living standards\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Economic activities including production, distribution, and consumption of goods and services collectively help improve the living standards of Pakistan\'s population.', 'A stronger economy means better goods and services available to people.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"Living Standards\\\",\\\"Economic Activities\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Production\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1529, '4252bacf-5049-4fd5-bb94-a7c3f6237a62', 30, 1, 'Which combination best describes what national income depends on in Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Only government taxation\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Agriculture, industry, trade, and financial services working together\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Only foreign remittances\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Only export earnings\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'Pakistan\'s national income is generated from the combined contribution of agriculture, industrial production, international trade, and financial services — all sectors working together.', 'No single sector alone determines national income.', 'hard', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"National Income\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\",\\\"Agriculture\\\",\\\"Industry\\\",\\\"Trade\\\"]\"', 'Economy of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 19:58:23', '2026-04-30 19:58:23'),
(1530, '4814f7e4-0d83-4c18-a5a3-6dec5d1d081f', 31, 1, 'Who designed the national flag of Pakistan?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Liaquat Ali Khan\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Hafeez Jalandhari\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Syed Amir-uddin Kedwaii\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Ahmad Ghulam Ali Chagla\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The national flag of Pakistan was designed by Syed Amir-uddin Kedwaii. It was officially adopted on 11 August 1947, just before Pakistan\'s independence.', 'The designer\'s name is different from the anthem composer and lyricist.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"National Flag\\\",\\\"Designer\\\",\\\"Syed Amir-uddin Kedwaii\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'National Symbols of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 20:04:33', '2026-04-30 20:04:33'),
(1531, '191af858-7968-4cf8-8c0c-0b2a4a05cb1b', 31, 1, 'When was the national flag of Pakistan officially adopted?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"14 August 1947\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"23 March 1940\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"11 August 1947\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"11 August 1954\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The national flag of Pakistan was officially adopted on 11 August 1947, just a few days before the creation of Pakistan on 14 August 1947.', 'It was adopted a few days BEFORE independence, not on independence day itself.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"National Flag\\\",\\\"Adopted\\\",\\\"11 August 1947\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'National Symbols of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 20:04:33', '2026-04-30 20:04:33'),
(1532, '50762b5f-3856-40b5-9e08-f54c3520de74', 31, 1, 'What does the green color of Pakistan\'s national flag represent?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"The fertile land of Pakistan\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Progress and knowledge\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"The Muslim majority of Pakistan\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"National unity and peace\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The green color of Pakistan\'s national flag represents the Muslim majority of the country, as green is the traditional color associated with Islam.', 'Green is historically associated with Islam and Muslim identity.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"National Flag\\\",\\\"Green Color\\\",\\\"Muslim Majority\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'National Symbols of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 20:04:33', '2026-04-30 20:04:33'),
(1533, 'c65af83a-2cc9-444e-bdf5-1f5f6619b8a2', 31, 1, 'What does the white vertical stripe on Pakistan\'s national flag represent?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"The purity of Islam\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Religious minorities and their rights and protection\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Peace with neighboring countries\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"The crescent moon\'s reflection\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The white stripe on the left side of Pakistan\'s flag represents the religious minorities living in the country, symbolizing their rights and protection.', 'White represents those who are not part of the Muslim majority.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"National Flag\\\",\\\"White Stripe\\\",\\\"Religious Minorities\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'National Symbols of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 20:04:33', '2026-04-30 20:04:33'),
(1534, 'cb847a21-08a5-44b4-8740-e41b78911c8d', 31, 1, 'What does the crescent moon on Pakistan\'s national flag symbolize?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Islam and faith\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Light and knowledge\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Progress\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Unity and discipline\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"3\\\"]\"', 'The crescent moon on Pakistan\'s national flag symbolizes progress, while the five-pointed star represents light and knowledge.', 'Crescent = progress; Star = light and knowledge — remember this pair.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"National Flag\\\",\\\"Crescent Moon\\\",\\\"Progress\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'National Symbols of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 20:04:33', '2026-04-30 20:04:33'),
(1535, '4743baff-e2c4-4c6d-a958-6a15e7161c1c', 31, 1, 'What does the five-pointed star on Pakistan\'s national flag represent?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"The five pillars of Islam\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Progress\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"The five provinces of Pakistan\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Light and knowledge\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"4\\\"]\"', 'The five-pointed star on Pakistan\'s national flag represents light and knowledge, while the crescent moon symbolizes progress.', 'Star = light and knowledge; Crescent = progress — remember this distinction.', 'medium', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"National Flag\\\",\\\"Star\\\",\\\"Light\\\",\\\"Knowledge\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'National Symbols of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 20:04:33', '2026-04-30 20:04:33'),
(1536, 'a343ab4e-3f3b-4e33-9308-9e23b974c3ef', 31, 1, 'How many points does the star on Pakistan\'s national flag have?', 'single', '\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Four\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Five\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Six\\\",\\\"4\\\":\\\"Eight\\\"}\"', '\"[\\\"2\\\"]\"', 'The star on Pakistan\'s national flag is a five-pointed star (pentagram), which together with the crescent moon appears in the green area of the flag.', 'Count the points — it is a standard five-pointed star.', 'easy', NULL, 1, 0, '\"[\\\"National Flag\\\",\\\"Five-Pointed Star\\\",\\\"Pakistan\\\"]\"', 'National Symbols of Pakistan - General Knowledge', '1', 0, 0, 'published', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 20:04:33', '2026-04-30 20:04:33');
